            "notes": "# **Power**  [Double Helix](item_808afc07-1398-4962-bf2c-f8e3b74014e3) \n\nThis power and  [Cratered](item_5bb876bf-52b5-496c-a9ea-b68e72ed3be1) are the core of this build. I like  [Double Helix](item_808afc07-1398-4962-bf2c-f8e3b74014e3)  because I can't aim.\n\n# -----------------------------------\n\n# **Items**\n\n###  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \n\n###  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) \n\n###  [Electrolytes](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900) \n\nI'm addicted to  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) I find it very difficult to not want to take it. If you find you simply *must* forgo it, I also like  [Running Shoes](item_950eccea-31a0-4a55-8c2a-75bf7920e1aa)",
