            "notes": "# **Power**  [Cratered](item_5bb876bf-52b5-496c-a9ea-b68e72ed3be1) \n\nHee hoo more rocket damage\n\n# -----------------------------------\n\n# **Items**\n\n###  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) \n\n###  [Compression Fatigues](item_a15ed6e6-1f60-4b4c-8f51-ad1ee1140ae3) \n\n [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) seems to be rather underrated right now in AP builds but it can feel so bad to play against despite its seeming lack of popularity. It also helps that I think I've seen maybe 5 people ever buy  [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) so far, which also lets items like  [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) and  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) thrive similarly. This item is especially effective when we pair it with  [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) next round since we can put it on our bullets (and then in round 5 user  [Super Visor](item_b3db0ab0-26b4-4d99-893d-175f6726c9e9) to aimbot with this too) and allow no one to charge in recklessly\n\nI'm just addicted to  [Compression Fatigues](item_a15ed6e6-1f60-4b4c-8f51-ad1ee1140ae3) I like my sprint speed. Sell this item if you are ever in need of cash, it really isn't all that effective.\n\nif you must sell something and you've ran out of greens, sell  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) and buy  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418), we were only using it for the AP boost anyway",
