            "notes": "# **Power**  [Peripheral Pulse](item_f024f11e-2fff-40cf-9e2d-fbaa21fa1371) \n\nJust a really good power to use with  [Super Visor](item_b3db0ab0-26b4-4d99-893d-175f6726c9e9) \n\nSince this isn't a gun build, though, it may feel a bit lackluster, and any of the biotic field powers are fun alternatives\n\n# -----------------------------------\n\n# **Items**\n\n###  [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) \n\n [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) feels really good to use on any AP build\n\n [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) is probably the best CDR item in the game and is a good optional item\n\n [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) might also be good since our ult isn't going to be the most useful beyond the first 3 shots since again this is a heavy ap build.",
